#### List available products in the store
GET http://localhost:3000/store
 
#### View specific ITEM_FAMILY
GET http://localhost:3000/store/1001
 
#### View specific ITEM_VARIANT
GET http://localhost:3000/store/1001/1
 

 
#### Add a quantity of item_id 1001 to the shopping cart
POST http://localhost:3000/cart
Content-Type: application/json
 
{
  "item_id": 1001,
  "quantity": 2
}

#### List current contents of cart
GET http://localhost:3000/cart
 
#### iew item on line 1 of cart
GET http://localhost:3000/cart/1
 
#### Edit quantity of item_id 1001 in the shopping cart
PUT http://localhost:3000/cart/1001
Content-Type: application/json
 
{
  "quantity": 3
} 

#### Remove all quantity (entire line item) of item_id 1001 from the shopping cart
DELETE http://localhost:3000/cart/1001


#### Process Order
#### Push content of shopping cart to the Payment Processing API
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json
 
{
  "user_id": 101,
  "payer_id": 1001,
  "shipping_address": 1001,
  "line_items": [
    {
      "item_id": 1001,
      "qty": 2,
      "price": 100.00,
      "discount_type": "percent",
      "discount_amount": 5
    },
    {
      "item_id": 1002,
      "qty": 1,
      "price": 100.00,
      "discount_type": "flat",
      "discount_amount": 15.00
    }
  ]
} 

#### Update the status of an existing order by id
PUT http://localhost:3000/orders/0
Content-Type: application/json
 
{
  "status": 1
} 


#### List previous orders
GET http://localhost:3000/orders
 
#### View specific past order by id
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/0
 
#### View line item in specific past order
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/0/1
 
